♪Let the daylight
pierce through the night♪

00:00:29.837 --> 00:00:32.645
♪Unveiling the dazzling galaxy♪

00:00:33.273 --> 00:00:37.137
♪This scorched remnant of myself♪

00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:42.872
♪In this world of capricious tides♪

00:00:43.632 --> 00:00:46.521
♪That perfect warmth♪

00:00:47.034 --> 00:00:50.992
♪You are my only star♪

00:00:52.168 --> 00:00:55.578
♪Heartless, obsessed, hopeful, loathing♪

00:00:55.648 --> 00:00:59.066
♪How can we escape the regretful pasts♪

00:00:59.712 --> 00:01:05.824
♪Watch the sky plunge into the sea♪

00:01:06.656 --> 00:01:12.422
♪As dawn's first light
sketches the sky's outline♪

00:01:12.422 --> 00:01:18.692
♪Entwined between our fingertips♪

00:01:20.256 --> 00:01:26.208
♪When destiny weaves a brilliant net♪

00:01:26.208 --> 00:01:32.000
♪Our souls are forged from the shards♪

00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:35.584
=Flying Up Without Disturb=

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.003
=Episode 6=

00:01:43.296 --> 00:01:44.136
Huan Zong?

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:45.375
Come on, help.

00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:46.296
- What happened?
- Hurry.

00:01:46.576 --> 00:01:47.735
Help me.

00:01:54.576 --> 00:01:55.696
What were you doing?

00:01:56.136 --> 00:01:57.375
Look at those.

00:01:57.455 --> 00:01:58.455
My sect people

00:01:58.455 --> 00:01:59.375
gave me those

00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:00.576
for self-defense.

00:02:01.255 --> 00:02:01.975
I see.

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:03.856
But you rushed out without learning

00:02:04.016 --> 00:02:05.056
how to use them.

00:02:05.615 --> 00:02:06.296
Exactly.

00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:07.455
What should I do now?

00:02:07.455 --> 00:02:08.655
It will be a long journey.

00:02:11.455 --> 00:02:12.816
You have a point.

00:02:13.215 --> 00:02:14.495
I'm worried about it for you.

00:02:14.735 --> 00:02:16.696
But thankfully, there's a solution.

00:02:18.416 --> 00:02:19.096
That's right.

00:02:19.256 --> 00:02:20.256
A master like you

00:02:20.376 --> 00:02:21.615
knows how to use them, right?

00:02:22.696 --> 00:02:23.775
Want me to teach you?

00:02:23.895 --> 00:02:24.655
Yeah, of course.

00:02:26.016 --> 00:02:27.495
We're not going the same way.

00:02:27.615 --> 00:02:28.576
How can I teach you?

00:02:28.816 --> 00:02:30.455
Well...

00:02:31.175 --> 00:02:33.136
Will you let me tag along?

00:02:33.256 --> 00:02:34.256
Please? Okay?

00:02:34.335 --> 00:02:35.576
You want to tag along?

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:37.856
You're in a rush

00:02:37.976 --> 00:02:39.096
to find the herbs.

00:02:39.175 --> 00:02:40.895
Will I be a burden to you?

00:02:40.976 --> 00:02:43.576
Yeah, I need to find the herbs.

00:02:43.935 --> 00:02:45.096
Let me think.

00:02:46.935 --> 00:02:48.455
You have to think about it?

00:02:49.016 --> 00:02:51.455
Huan Zong, just take me with you.

00:02:51.576 --> 00:02:52.376
I swear I won't

00:02:52.376 --> 00:02:53.495
cause you any trouble.

00:02:54.856 --> 00:02:56.136
I thought about it.

00:02:56.256 --> 00:02:58.016
I do need your help.

00:02:58.976 --> 00:02:59.816
Exactly.

00:02:59.935 --> 00:03:00.735
You know

00:03:00.735 --> 00:03:02.256
I'm extremely lucky.

00:03:02.335 --> 00:03:03.455
I'll definitely help you

00:03:03.455 --> 00:03:04.256
find the herbs.

00:03:04.296 --> 00:03:05.256
Besides,

00:03:05.696 --> 00:03:06.976
I'm injured

00:03:07.096 --> 00:03:08.816
and need protection.

00:03:08.935 --> 00:03:09.935
That's right.

00:03:10.136 --> 00:03:12.096
I may not be as skilled as Lin Hu,

00:03:12.096 --> 00:03:12.735
but

00:03:12.735 --> 00:03:13.416
it's better

00:03:13.416 --> 00:03:14.536
than nothing.

00:03:15.376 --> 00:03:16.455
You're right.

00:03:16.735 --> 00:03:18.136
But would it

00:03:18.215 --> 00:03:19.376
hinder your trials

00:03:19.455 --> 00:03:20.416
if you came with us?

00:03:20.576 --> 00:03:21.455
Of course not.

00:03:21.536 --> 00:03:22.455
Didn't I tell you

00:03:22.455 --> 00:03:23.775
my ultimate goal?

00:03:26.296 --> 00:03:28.416
You want to be a heroine
who upholds justice

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:29.856
and vanquishes evil

00:03:30.016 --> 00:03:31.775
like in the storybooks,

00:03:32.016 --> 00:03:33.495
and eradicate injustice

00:03:33.536 --> 00:03:35.816
from every corner of the world.

00:03:35.935 --> 00:03:36.455
Exactly.

00:03:36.895 --> 00:03:37.775
Also,

00:03:37.895 --> 00:03:38.816
I told you

00:03:38.935 --> 00:03:40.696
that I want to help

00:03:40.735 --> 00:03:42.016
every person in need.

00:03:42.136 --> 00:03:42.895
Perfect.

00:03:42.976 --> 00:03:44.215
Right now, I'm the one

00:03:44.215 --> 00:03:45.775
who needs help most.

00:03:45.976 --> 00:03:46.895
Exactly.

00:03:46.976 --> 00:03:47.816
See?

00:03:47.856 --> 00:03:49.296
You won't hinder the trials.

00:03:49.416 --> 00:03:50.615
Just bring me along.

00:03:50.735 --> 00:03:52.816
We'll help each other.

00:03:56.615 --> 00:03:57.615
Alright.

00:03:57.696 --> 00:03:58.536
Nice!

00:03:58.536 --> 00:03:59.256
Rest assured.

00:03:59.296 --> 00:04:00.735
I'll definitely

00:04:00.856 --> 00:04:01.856
help you collect

00:04:01.856 --> 00:04:03.096
all those herbs.

00:04:12.856 --> 00:04:13.696
How did it go?

00:04:13.816 --> 00:04:14.536
Senior.

00:04:15.055 --> 00:04:15.935
Xiao Dong is looking

00:04:16.016 --> 00:04:17.176
into the puppets.

00:04:17.256 --> 00:04:18.616
Don't worry too much.

00:04:21.696 --> 00:04:22.295
Take a seat.

00:04:27.736 --> 00:04:29.295
But I never expected that

00:04:29.415 --> 00:04:30.376
Zhong Xi would obtain

00:04:30.455 --> 00:04:32.056
the Azure Phoenix Feather so soon.

00:04:32.696 --> 00:04:33.496
I must visit

00:04:33.576 --> 00:04:34.415
the Zhaohan Sect

00:04:34.535 --> 00:04:35.975
to show my gratitude.

00:04:37.095 --> 00:04:38.895
But should we hide the fact

00:04:39.056 --> 00:04:40.616
that Zhong Xi is injured?

00:04:41.895 --> 00:04:43.775
Keep it a secret for now.

00:04:44.335 --> 00:04:45.335
That child

00:04:45.455 --> 00:04:46.256
carries the hope

00:04:46.335 --> 00:04:47.696
of the entire Lingyou Realm.

00:04:47.895 --> 00:04:48.616
Everyone

00:04:48.736 --> 00:04:50.136
is waiting for his ascension

00:04:50.215 --> 00:04:52.335
to breach the celestial barrier

00:04:52.455 --> 00:04:53.655
and pave the way

00:04:53.775 --> 00:04:55.936
for all cultivators' ascension.

00:04:56.775 --> 00:04:57.855
Unfortunately,

00:04:57.975 --> 00:04:59.855
he's been fighting the dark cultivators

00:04:59.975 --> 00:05:01.576
and missed his ascension window.

00:05:02.496 --> 00:05:03.775
If people find out

00:05:03.895 --> 00:05:05.415
that his spiritual core is damaged

00:05:05.415 --> 00:05:06.655
and he can't ascend,

00:05:06.936 --> 00:05:08.215
the cultivators

00:05:08.855 --> 00:05:10.855
might lose all motivation.

00:05:12.295 --> 00:05:14.215
You are right.

00:05:15.496 --> 00:05:16.535
Hurry up.

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:18.895
Inform Zhong Xi immediately.

00:05:23.736 --> 00:05:24.215
Now,

00:05:24.295 --> 00:05:25.256
where are we going?

00:05:25.415 --> 00:05:26.335
We're going to Fengyi

00:05:26.415 --> 00:05:27.455
for Cloudseeker Twig.

00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:30.816
I really don't know

00:05:31.095 --> 00:05:32.176
why we should bring

00:05:32.176 --> 00:05:33.335
this annoying girl.

00:05:33.455 --> 00:05:35.016
She just offered a phoenix feather.

00:05:35.455 --> 00:05:37.056
She clearly wants you

00:05:37.176 --> 00:05:38.696
to boost her spiritual energy.

00:05:39.016 --> 00:05:41.455
Lin Hu, what are you muttering?

00:05:41.775 --> 00:05:43.696
Nothing. I didn't say anything.

00:05:45.775 --> 00:05:47.095
Don't listen to him.

00:05:47.136 --> 00:05:48.136
I'm not coveting

00:05:48.256 --> 00:05:49.215
your spiritual energy.

00:05:49.895 --> 00:05:50.855
I swear.

00:05:51.095 --> 00:05:53.376
I just think friends should

00:05:53.496 --> 00:05:55.136
support each other out here...

00:05:57.295 --> 00:05:58.975
I wasn't up to something.

00:06:04.775 --> 00:06:05.895
Oh, come on.

00:06:07.335 --> 00:06:08.295
It's alright.

00:06:08.415 --> 00:06:09.576
Thankfully,

00:06:09.655 --> 00:06:11.176
you didn't drag me down.

00:06:11.496 --> 00:06:13.016
Huan Zong, you...

00:06:24.616 --> 00:06:25.295
Thank you.

00:06:30.816 --> 00:06:31.696
Young Master.

00:06:32.016 --> 00:06:33.736
It looks like a nice place.

00:06:33.775 --> 00:06:34.335
Let's take

00:06:34.335 --> 00:06:34.936
a break.

00:06:35.616 --> 00:06:36.936
Rest here.

00:06:36.936 --> 00:06:38.136
I'll contact Master.

00:06:38.295 --> 00:06:39.256
You can do it here.

00:06:39.376 --> 00:06:40.576
Why would you walk away?

00:06:40.696 --> 00:06:41.215
There's

00:06:41.215 --> 00:06:42.455
something we shouldn't know?

00:06:42.895 --> 00:06:44.376
Not exactly.

00:06:44.496 --> 00:06:46.016
It's just that Master wouldn't

00:06:46.095 --> 00:06:47.415
let me go out with Huan Zong.

00:06:47.535 --> 00:06:48.816
I have to be discreet.

00:06:48.895 --> 00:06:49.895
Remember.

00:06:49.895 --> 00:06:50.335
No matter

00:06:50.335 --> 00:06:51.455
what you hear,

00:06:51.455 --> 00:06:52.535
don't come close.

00:06:53.016 --> 00:06:54.056
If Master detects

00:06:54.056 --> 00:06:55.095
your presence,

00:06:55.095 --> 00:06:55.936
he might rush over

00:06:55.936 --> 00:06:56.975
to drag me back,

00:06:56.975 --> 00:06:58.016
and I won't be able

00:06:58.136 --> 00:06:58.696
to hang out

00:06:58.855 --> 00:06:59.936
with you again.

00:07:00.095 --> 00:07:01.136
Got it.

00:07:01.256 --> 00:07:02.696
Remember. Stay put.

00:07:02.775 --> 00:07:03.455
Got it.

00:07:05.655 --> 00:07:06.535
Go ahead.

00:07:13.855 --> 00:07:14.535
Master.

00:07:14.535 --> 00:07:15.496
It's me, Kong Hou,

00:07:15.535 --> 00:07:16.415
checking in on you.

00:07:17.016 --> 00:07:17.736
Problem solved

00:07:17.855 --> 00:07:19.056
in Qiu City.

00:07:19.215 --> 00:07:19.736
Next,

00:07:19.975 --> 00:07:21.136
we're heading to Fengyi.

00:07:21.256 --> 00:07:22.535
Oh right, Master.

00:07:22.655 --> 00:07:24.335
I'm carrying many spiritual tools.

00:07:24.376 --> 00:07:25.176
Each can ward off

00:07:25.295 --> 00:07:26.655
hordes of monsters.

00:07:26.775 --> 00:07:28.136
So please don't worry

00:07:28.256 --> 00:07:28.936
about me.

00:07:29.176 --> 00:07:29.855
Besides,

00:07:29.975 --> 00:07:30.616
I'll be

00:07:30.616 --> 00:07:31.855
extra careful.

00:07:31.855 --> 00:07:33.335
Young Master, I don't get it.

00:07:33.535 --> 00:07:35.136
We're in a rush to find the herbs.

00:07:35.136 --> 00:07:36.895
Why are we bringing her along?

00:07:37.696 --> 00:07:39.415
The dark cultivators

00:07:39.696 --> 00:07:40.535
probably scared her.

00:07:40.696 --> 00:07:41.415
Why do you care

00:07:41.415 --> 00:07:42.736
if she's scared?

00:07:44.016 --> 00:07:45.335
You're just

00:07:45.455 --> 00:07:46.496
too compassionate.

00:07:46.736 --> 00:07:48.095
You care about her.

00:07:48.335 --> 00:07:49.136
But she hides

00:07:49.176 --> 00:07:49.975
over there to send

00:07:49.975 --> 00:07:51.056
a message.

00:07:51.295 --> 00:07:52.136
No matter what,

00:07:52.136 --> 00:07:53.936
we're from a respected sect.

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:55.655
Why does she look down on us?

00:07:56.095 --> 00:07:57.415
Master Wang Tong

00:07:57.535 --> 00:07:59.295
forbids Kong Hou
from regulating my energy

00:07:59.415 --> 00:08:00.496
because it might

00:08:00.616 --> 00:08:02.176
attract thunder strikes.

00:08:03.576 --> 00:08:04.535
Now I get it.

00:08:04.816 --> 00:08:05.376
No wonder

00:08:05.496 --> 00:08:06.535
he assumed that

00:08:06.535 --> 00:08:07.975
I went to find Kong Hou

00:08:07.975 --> 00:08:09.535
to help regulate your energy.

00:08:10.415 --> 00:08:11.975
Didn't you explain it?

00:08:12.136 --> 00:08:12.895
I...

00:08:13.975 --> 00:08:15.655
You didn't tell him

00:08:15.775 --> 00:08:17.176
that you only wanted to confirm

00:08:17.176 --> 00:08:19.016
if Kong Hou returned home safely?

00:08:19.376 --> 00:08:20.256
I...

00:08:21.016 --> 00:08:21.895
Come on.

00:08:21.895 --> 00:08:22.576
You know

00:08:22.576 --> 00:08:23.455
back then,

00:08:23.535 --> 00:08:24.535
the moment I entered,

00:08:24.535 --> 00:08:26.136
that old man tried to kick me out.

00:08:26.136 --> 00:08:27.095
What could I

00:08:27.095 --> 00:08:28.016
possibly say?

00:08:28.095 --> 00:08:29.616
Right, I heard him saying

00:08:29.816 --> 00:08:30.256
that

00:08:30.256 --> 00:08:32.216
Kong Hou had to regulate energy with you

00:08:32.216 --> 00:08:34.016
to play the phoenix-headed konghou.

00:08:34.136 --> 00:08:35.336
How could I let her do that?

00:08:35.415 --> 00:08:36.935
I was too furious.

00:08:37.055 --> 00:08:37.775
So I came back

00:08:37.895 --> 00:08:39.456
without explaining it.

00:08:41.295 --> 00:08:42.055
Are you done?

00:08:42.175 --> 00:08:42.695
Yeah.

00:08:43.575 --> 00:08:44.815
Foxes sure talk a lot.

00:08:45.976 --> 00:08:47.415
Wait, listen.

00:08:57.295 --> 00:08:58.736
Another little rabbit.

00:08:58.895 --> 00:09:00.216
Looks delicious.

00:09:00.336 --> 00:09:00.856
Brother,

00:09:00.976 --> 00:09:02.935
save the tender face for me.

00:09:03.096 --> 00:09:04.456
Those fingers must be crispy.

00:09:04.456 --> 00:09:06.136
Who are you? State your names.

00:09:06.856 --> 00:09:08.256
"State your names".

00:09:11.136 --> 00:09:11.775
Take a look.

00:09:12.016 --> 00:09:13.216
Why?

00:09:13.336 --> 00:09:14.456
Didn't you hear her?

00:09:14.575 --> 00:09:16.016
No matter what happens,

00:09:16.136 --> 00:09:17.415
we shouldn't go over there.

00:09:17.456 --> 00:09:18.256
If you go there,

00:09:18.415 --> 00:09:18.976
she might

00:09:19.096 --> 00:09:20.535
get angry with you.

00:09:20.695 --> 00:09:22.016
If her master sees me,

00:09:22.136 --> 00:09:23.456
he'll take her back.

00:09:24.736 --> 00:09:25.575
Wait.

00:09:25.856 --> 00:09:26.856
Something's wrong.

00:09:27.616 --> 00:09:28.295
How dare you

00:09:28.295 --> 00:09:30.336
cause trouble in broad daylight?

00:09:36.695 --> 00:09:37.695
Don't be afraid.

00:09:37.856 --> 00:09:39.496
(Zhou Xiao, Yuanji Sect)
I'm Zhou Xiao, the chief disciple

00:09:39.575 --> 00:09:40.376
of the Yuanji Sect.

00:09:40.496 --> 00:09:41.616
I'll protect you.

00:09:43.535 --> 00:09:44.575
Thank you.

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:49.504
(Jin Ling, Yuanji Sect)

00:09:51.256 --> 00:09:52.575
(She's a music cultivator.)

00:09:52.695 --> 00:09:53.336
Xiao.

00:10:37.256 --> 00:10:38.895
Why don't you stay and fight?

00:10:59.016 --> 00:10:59.815
Young lady,

00:10:59.935 --> 00:11:01.055
I hope you weren't scared.

00:11:01.616 --> 00:11:02.976
Thank you for your help.

00:11:03.096 --> 00:11:04.895
I'm Kong Hou from Yunhua Sect's

00:11:05.016 --> 00:11:05.695
Qiyue Peak.

00:11:06.016 --> 00:11:06.976
Lady Kong Hou

00:11:07.096 --> 00:11:08.096
from the Yunhua Sect.

00:11:08.216 --> 00:11:08.935
Nice to meet you.

00:11:09.055 --> 00:11:10.016
No need for formalities.

00:11:10.096 --> 00:11:11.295
Since we came across

00:11:11.415 --> 00:11:12.616
those dark cultivators,

00:11:12.736 --> 00:11:13.695
we had to act.

00:11:13.815 --> 00:11:14.815
Fate brought us together.

00:11:14.935 --> 00:11:16.136
Why don't you come and stay

00:11:16.136 --> 00:11:16.895
at Yuanji Sect

00:11:17.016 --> 00:11:17.856
for a few days?

00:11:18.136 --> 00:11:19.655
No, it's okay.

00:11:20.695 --> 00:11:21.415
Young lady.

00:11:21.535 --> 00:11:22.496
- My friends and I
- Young lady.

00:11:22.616 --> 00:11:23.415
have things to do.

00:11:23.575 --> 00:11:24.415
We have to go.

00:11:24.535 --> 00:11:25.535
Right, Huan Zong?

00:11:25.535 --> 00:11:26.256
No rush.

00:11:27.376 --> 00:11:28.935
Haven't you always wanted

00:11:29.016 --> 00:11:30.775
to play the phoenix-headed konghou?

00:11:31.376 --> 00:11:33.415
This lady here
is a music cultivator too.

00:11:35.136 --> 00:11:35.895
How about this?

00:11:36.336 --> 00:11:37.976
Go seek her guidance.

00:11:38.256 --> 00:11:38.815
Go on.

00:11:43.096 --> 00:11:44.256
My junior sister Jin Ling

00:11:44.336 --> 00:11:45.055
is a renowned

00:11:45.175 --> 00:11:46.256
music cultivator.

00:11:46.415 --> 00:11:47.216
Why don't you

00:11:47.216 --> 00:11:48.376
talk to each other?

00:11:48.695 --> 00:11:49.496
Jin Ling?

00:11:49.575 --> 00:11:50.376
So you're the 11th

00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:51.256
musical cultivator

00:11:51.256 --> 00:11:52.295
in the Lingyou Realm.

00:11:52.295 --> 00:11:53.415
That's right.

00:11:55.616 --> 00:11:57.175
You can't even play

00:11:57.175 --> 00:11:58.055
your natal weapon?

00:12:01.456 --> 00:12:03.055
It's not like that.

00:12:03.256 --> 00:12:05.096
I'm just not proficient yet.

00:12:05.256 --> 00:12:06.496
It'll improve with practice.

00:12:06.655 --> 00:12:07.175
Since

00:12:07.175 --> 00:12:08.415
I'm visiting your sect,

00:12:08.575 --> 00:12:09.815
I will seek your guidance.

00:12:09.976 --> 00:12:11.136
Come on, let's go.

00:12:11.256 --> 00:12:12.136
Young lady.

00:12:12.295 --> 00:12:13.895
Our sect is this way.

00:12:17.775 --> 00:12:18.415
This way?

00:12:18.415 --> 00:12:19.055
After you.

00:12:19.055 --> 00:12:19.935
Alright.

00:12:21.336 --> 00:12:22.456
Zhou Xiao.

00:12:26.376 --> 00:12:28.256
We're Liuguang Sect disciples.

00:12:28.736 --> 00:12:30.136
May we also visit

00:12:30.415 --> 00:12:31.535
your esteemed sect?

00:12:33.295 --> 00:12:34.815
(What if they interfere...)

00:12:34.935 --> 00:12:36.175
(But I can't offend)

00:12:36.336 --> 00:12:37.736
(the Liuguang Sect.)

00:12:38.736 --> 00:12:40.376
Liuguang Sect disciples

00:12:40.376 --> 00:12:41.415
are more than welcome.

00:12:41.575 --> 00:12:42.976
This way.

00:12:43.415 --> 00:12:44.256
Thank you.

00:12:44.496 --> 00:12:45.216
Please.

00:12:46.895 --> 00:12:47.815
Tiring journey, huh?

00:12:47.935 --> 00:12:49.016
Not at all.

00:12:49.575 --> 00:12:51.136
We have splendid scenery.

00:12:51.295 --> 00:12:52.016
I will definitely

00:12:52.016 --> 00:12:52.775
show you around.

00:12:52.775 --> 00:12:53.336
Alright.

00:12:56.775 --> 00:12:58.535
